# Pulls in CONFIG_ALIRO_UD_NFC_* (including
# CONFIG_ALIRO_UD_TIMING_INSTRUMENTATION), CONFIG_ALIRO_UD_OS_*, and friends:
# this test builds the real platform/nfc/nfc_worker.cpp,
# platform/nfc/command_timing.cpp, and platform/os/*.cpp sources directly
# (see CMakeLists.txt), so it needs the same Kconfig options they reference,
# normally sourced via the application's own Kconfig.
